18	/**
19	 * Self-service backup restore handler.
20	 *
21	 * Restores a selected vzdump archive back onto the server's existing VM via the
22	 * Proxmox API: stop -> restore (force overwrite) -> start. Ownership and archive
23	 * validation are enforced at enqueue time (`lib/actions-server-ops.ts`), so this
24	 * handler trusts the `volid` in the job payload.
